<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal injects 10 bln esc avg 6.52 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal injects 10 bln esc avg 6.52 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said it injected 10 billion escudos of one-day funds into the money market at an average 6.52 percent in a variable rate repurchase pact effective tomorrow.</p>
<p>The central bank also said it injected 16.52 billion escudos into the money market in a last-hour repo at an average 7.60 percent.</p>
</text>
